# =========================================================================
# VVDN -- KICH BAN CAT HA CANH, 60 PHUT, HUONG 35, MOT PHA -- MIX 1D2A
# 35L ha canh (ILS) / 35R cat canh -- hai duong CHC song song PHU THUOC
# =========================================================================
# Sinh boi _gen_vvdn_1d2a.py, seed 20261118. Quy tac: vvdn_1d2a_rules.json + vvdn_xenke_rules.json.
# Mix: 1D2A (chu ky: tau den - tau di - tau den)
# Quy mo: 28 chuyen den + 14 chuyen di = 42 chuyen dong (+2 tau giu diem cho, khong chay da)
# Co cau: DEN 19 MEDIUM + 9 HEAVY | DI 10 MEDIUM + 4 HEAVY; HEAVY rai deu ca 60 phut
# Loi thoat: 9 tau HEAVY qua G6 ve ben 8, 19 tau MEDIUM qua G4 ve ben 28
# Cham banh dau 00:01:35.000, cuoi 00:59:53.810; chay da cuoi 00:58:08.670
# Nhip cham banh TB 129.6 s (nho nhat 114.0, lon nhat 141.4)
#
# PHAN CACH AP DUNG:
#   Cat canh 35R vs tau den ke tiep tren 35L (NM, hang = tau cat canh, cot = tau ha canh): H H=6, H M=7, M H=5, M M=5
#     (tinh tai luc cap huan lenh = chay da - 10 s code C / 15 s code D tro len)
#   Huan lenh cat canh 2 s sau khi tau den cham banh; tau chay da sau huan lenh 10 s (code C) / 15 s (code D tro len)
#   Tau ha canh truoc thoat ly het khoi 35L (duoi tau qua vach dung cho 35L) truoc khi tau sau toi 2 NM
#   Tau ha canh truoc cat qua het 35R truoc khi tau sau vuot nguong 35L (du thao muc 3)
#   Ha canh lien tiep 35L, cat canh lien tiep 35R: theo vvdn_xenke_rules.json
#   Duong lan E: tau code D/E/F cat canh thi chi tau code C o tren E (du thao muc 3)
#   Tau di nhuong tau den tren doan duong lan dung chung
#   Diem cho truoc 35R: toi da 3 tau, gom ca tau da len CHC
#
# GIA DINH:
#   Tau den/di dau tien tao giua duong luc 0 de khong co pha khoi dong; khong gio, khong bay lai; ASAS OFF.
#   Tau di bi xoa 420 s sau chay da; tau den bi xoa khi toi ben; pha lan dieu khien bang MOVE nhip 2 s.
#
# CANH BAO KHI SINH:
#   (khong co)
# =========================================================================

